# Test Publishing helper configuration
# Verify GitHub publishing is configured (default).
# sbt 2.x: GithubPublishing uses plain publishTo (the old sbt-github-packages
# githubOwner/githubRepository keys no longer exist).
> show publishTo
> show resolvers
# A stale sbt server must not be able to publish a version naming another commit.
> checkStalenessLogic
# Prerelease/RC classification -- isSnapshot cannot answer this.
> checkPrereleaseClassification
> checkPrereleaseSettings
# An RC must not be published as npm's `latest`.
> checkDistTagRule
> checkDistTagDefault
# publishLocal warns rather than fails, so it must still succeed.
> publishLocal
